# Simpan line ending LF di basis data repo, meski checkout di Windows.
# Tanpa hal ini setiap `git add` memberi peringatan "LF will be replaced by CRLF".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Biner tidak boleh dimodifikasi
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary

*.php  text
*.js   text
*.css  text
*.sql  text
*.md   text
*.html text
